Package: boswas-device-agent
Architecture: all
Depends: boswas-compat (>= 1.0~alpha3),
         openssl,
         python3 (>= 3.11),
         systemd,
         ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: boswas-cli
Description: Boswas OS device agent
 The local device agent of Boswas OS:
 .
  * a persistent, random device identity (never derived from hardware
    serial numbers, MAC addresses or user names)
  * device state, an allowlisted inventory and posture reporting
  * a local management API (Unix socket) used by boswas-device and the
    Boswas Compatibility Manager
  * a per-user session agent that runs Windows applications through
    boswas-winapp, so bubblewrap, AppArmor and policy always apply
  * optional connection to a Boswas Control Plane over mutual TLS: enrollment
    with a one-time token, heartbeats, signed policies and typed management
    commands (no remote shell), with an outbox for offline periods
 .
 Without a Control Plane the device works fully standalone.
